{{ ansible_managed | comment('c') }}
//
// Read after 50unattended-upgrades, whose origins list (the security pocket
// only) is deliberately left alone.

// A study can run for hours, and a machine that reboots on its own in the
// middle of one loses it. Kernel and libc updates therefore wait for an
// operator; `needrestart` or `/var/run/reboot-required` will say when.
Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot "{{ 'true' if hardening_unattended_reboot | bool else 'false' }}";
